" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUJIWARA TATSUNORI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MORIMOTO TAKAO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SATO MASAO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJIWARA, TATSUNORI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MORIMOTO, TAKAO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SATO, MASAO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A CD (disc) is carried by a carrying roller (11), the lower surface of an MD (cartridge) holder (25) and guides (101, 102) for clamping by a clamper at the tip end of a clamp lever (17). An MD (24) is carried in by a holder pulling lever (39) constituting a part of an MD carrying mechanism, while being fitted in an MD holder (25), for mounting on a turntable. A clamp lever retracting mechanism is provided which retracts the clamp lever (17) to a position not interfering with the carrying-in and removal of the MD (24) before the MD (24) is carried in or removed by the MD carrying mechanism.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un CD transporté par un rouleau de transport (11), la surface inférieure d'un porte-MD (cartouche) (25) et des guides (101, 102) aux fins de verrouillage par un système de verrouillage placé à l'extrémité d'un bras de verrouillage (17). L'introduction d'un MD (24) s'effectue par le biais d'un levier de traction de porte-MD (39) faisant partie intégrante d'un mécanisme de transport de MD, qui intervient lorsque le MD est déplacé au moment de l'insertion dans le porte-MD (25), aux fins de positionnement sur un plateau tourne-disque. Un mécanisme de rétraction de levier de verrouillage permet de rétracter le levier de verrouillage (17) en position ne gênant pas l'introduction et l'extraction du MD (24), avant l'introduction ou l'extraction du MD (24) par le mécanisme de transport de MD.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>